{"3902740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone", "steam_appid": 3902740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i> puts your piloting skills to the test in intense first-person drone missions. Experience smooth, responsive drone controls as you navigate hostile skies from an immersive FPV view. Dodge enemy fire, avoid jammers and radars, and precisely crash into high-value targets like tanks, artillery, and enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.poster.avif?t=1771588350\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.webm?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.mp4?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different drones, each with unique flight characteristics and explosive payloads. Upgrade and customize your fleet to fit your playstyle—whether you prefer fast and agile strikes or heavy, powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.poster.avif?t=1771588350\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.webm?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.mp4?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic flight physics, challenging objectives, and explosive action, <i>Kamikaze Strike</i> delivers an exciting blend of pilot skill and tactical combat for drone and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/a85a7de9d52369afae00d61b459948fd.avif?t=1771588350\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i> puts your piloting skills to the test in intense first-person drone missions. Experience smooth, responsive drone controls as you navigate hostile skies from an immersive FPV view. Dodge enemy fire, avoid jammers and radars, and precisely crash into high-value targets like tanks, artillery, and enemy bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.poster.avif?t=1771588350\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.webm?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.mp4?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different drones, each with unique flight characteristics and explosive payloads. Upgrade and customize your fleet to fit your playstyle—whether you prefer fast and agile strikes or heavy, powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.poster.avif?t=1771588350\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.webm?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.mp4?t=1771588350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic flight physics, challenging objectives, and explosive action, <i>Kamikaze Strike</i> delivers an exciting blend of pilot skill and tactical combat for drone and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/extras/a85a7de9d52369afae00d61b459948fd.avif?t=1771588350\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Fly a kamikaze drone through fast-paced FPV missions. Dodge bullets, sneak past jammers and radars, and crash into tanks, troops, and enemy bases. Discover diffferent drones and face tougher challenges in every level.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Hungarian, Norwegian, Romanian, Thai, Greek, Czech, Swedish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902740/237e7